WEBVTT

00:23.480 --> 00:26.380
Where am I?

00:27.630 --> 00:30.700
Shackles?! On my legs as well?!

00:33.130 --> 00:34.630
And a collar?

00:37.970 --> 00:43.560
I see. It appears I've 
been taken prisoner.

00:45.300 --> 00:47.390
After being defeated by mere barbarians...

01:00.050 --> 01:06.480
1342 Anno Draconis
In the east of the continent—

Barbarian Territory

01:33.950 --> 01:35.820
Rifle brigade, take positions!

01:39.080 --> 01:40.320
Fire!

01:44.810 --> 01:46.330
Keep shooting!

01:48.700 --> 01:51.630
Captain! The barbarians' 
resistance is too fierce!

01:51.630 --> 01:53.110
The volunteer troops are wiped out,

01:53.110 --> 01:55.090
and front line of our 
left wing has collapsed!

01:55.410 --> 01:58.590
Compose yourself! Or are you not a knight 
of Illodren's Eastern Expedition?!

01:59.320 --> 02:00.870
Have the left wing pull back!

02:00.870 --> 02:04.500
Extend the center and right outwards 
into a partial wing formation!

02:04.920 --> 02:08.760
We'll deflect the savages' attacks 
and begin a fighting retreat!

02:05.490 --> 02:09.230
m 10 0 l 185 0 l 195 10 l 195 50 l 185 60 l 185 60 l 10 60 l 0 50 l 0 10

02:05.490 --> 02:09.230
Illdoren Kingdom
 Eastern Expeditionary Force
First Company Captain
 Serafina de Lavillant

02:18.550 --> 02:21.300
Still, even if we're able 
to force our way past them,

02:21.300 --> 02:23.240
we've lost too many from our 
primary forces.

02:23.240 --> 02:26.850
Any further losses will affect 
our chances of returning home.

02:27.170 --> 02:31.250
This will mark the end of the seven-year 
long 17th Eastern Expedition...

02:31.250 --> 02:34.660
I need to ensure as many of my comrades 
return home alive as possible.

02:55.970 --> 02:57.630
That crystal helmet...

02:57.620 --> 03:00.080
m 10 0 l 160 0 l 170 10 l 170 60 l 160 70 l 160 70 l 10 70 l 0 60 l 0 10

02:57.620 --> 03:00.080
"Thundering Voice"
Veor

02:57.780 --> 03:00.070
I take it you're 
the Eastern Expedition's general?

03:00.390 --> 03:03.960
I've grown tired facing 
these mere foot soldiers.

03:04.360 --> 03:06.830
Will you face me alone?

03:07.660 --> 03:10.330
Of all the times for one 
of their elite to appear...

03:10.990 --> 03:14.610
But if I ignore someone with a blade 
that can shred plate armor like paper,

03:14.610 --> 03:16.100
the withdrawal will never succeed.

03:17.330 --> 03:18.990
Is it overconfidence?

03:18.990 --> 03:21.340
If they're willing to take 
this into individual combat,

03:21.340 --> 03:22.340
I have no reason to refuse.

03:22.820 --> 03:23.690
Lieutenant!

03:23.690 --> 03:24.600
Y-Yes?!

03:25.160 --> 03:26.930
Numbers will do us no 
good against that one.

03:27.420 --> 03:28.890
You must take it from here.

03:28.890 --> 03:32.350
Let my brother know that I gave 
my life in service to my homeland!

03:58.850 --> 04:02.380
Princess Wysteresia! 
Please, lend me your strength!

04:20.410 --> 04:21.730
This is as far as I go...

04:22.810 --> 04:26.990
Well done. There are few who have 
stood against me as long as you have.

04:29.110 --> 04:29.820
Kill me!

04:29.820 --> 04:31.250
I refuse.

04:33.330 --> 04:35.740
Instead, you will be mine.

04:36.340 --> 04:40.690
Fear not. You survival isn't in question.

04:40.690 --> 04:45.290
Not when I can think of 
good uses for that body.

04:52.110 --> 04:58.670
That's right... I was... 
taken away as his spoils.

04:59.310 --> 05:03.110
W-Will they be putting me to work 
in the fields, like livestock?

05:03.110 --> 05:07.810
No, torture to learn what
they can will likely come first...

05:08.160 --> 05:13.070
They took me alive. I have to imagine 
that was done with a plan in mind.

05:14.740 --> 05:18.290
Not when I can think of 
good uses for that body.

05:20.100 --> 05:22.590
I-I hate to even consider it...

05:22.980 --> 05:26.040
but if I was captured 
because I'm a woman...

05:30.180 --> 05:32.550
Will they make sport of me?!

05:35.220 --> 05:38.580
What a shameful state of affairs 
for an unmarried noble woman!

05:38.580 --> 05:42.190
Am I in the den of a pack of animals?!

05:42.930 --> 05:46.860
And what's become of the troops 
who swore to fight for me?!

05:47.660 --> 05:49.770
The amount of time I was able to buy

05:49.770 --> 05:53.390
couldn't possibly have been enough 
for an organized withdrawal!

05:53.390 --> 05:55.300
Even if the rear was able to get away,

05:55.300 --> 05:57.830
the front lines would have
been broken into pieces...

05:59.860 --> 06:03.390
Likely either struck down
or wasting away in the wilds...

06:05.640 --> 06:07.840
But more pressing than that...

06:12.350 --> 06:15.970
Without control over the eastern 
lands, where the barbarians rule,

06:16.530 --> 06:18.390
the people of the capital will...

06:26.990 --> 06:30.140
The frustration of being unable 
to defend the people's livelihood,

06:30.140 --> 06:31.270
as is a noble's duty...

06:32.850 --> 06:35.150
You're certainly taking the "noble" 
part of the title literally.

06:37.480 --> 06:38.300
Who are you?!

06:41.030 --> 06:46.000
My name is Cersei. 
I serve the man who captured you.

06:49.370 --> 06:50.630
I see.

06:52.230 --> 06:55.080
Are you here to press me for intelligence?

06:55.690 --> 06:59.100
Intelligence? What are you talking about?

07:00.480 --> 07:02.600
Do not play ignorant, barbarian girl!

07:02.600 --> 07:04.430
You're here to use 
those strange implements

07:04.430 --> 07:07.090
to force me to talk, aren't you?!

07:07.690 --> 07:10.740
I was only given one command.

07:12.230 --> 07:14.190
To make sure that you, 
his victory trophy,

07:14.190 --> 07:16.990
are in a condition that is to his liking.

07:17.290 --> 07:19.000
Trophy...?

07:23.860 --> 07:25.960
W-What are you doing?!

07:26.210 --> 07:29.510
Isn't it obvious? It'll be harder 
if you're able to struggle.

07:32.470 --> 07:34.200
So, it begins...

07:34.610 --> 07:38.440
But these restraints... just how 
vicious will my treatment be?

07:38.830 --> 07:40.600
But even so, I...

07:41.780 --> 07:44.140
will not submit to mere torture!

07:49.630 --> 07:52.460
She'll likely be awake by now...

07:54.060 --> 07:56.290
My treasure.

08:07.770 --> 08:11.590
What is this? What is the meaning of this?

08:16.470 --> 08:19.520
There. You're a lot cleaner than you were.

08:19.880 --> 08:21.690
Seriously, what are you doing?!

08:22.140 --> 08:24.450
I'm not sure what you expect me to say.

08:24.450 --> 08:28.190
I was wiping the blood 
and filth off of you.

08:28.190 --> 08:29.900
I mean, you were a mess.

08:29.900 --> 08:30.780
What?

08:31.060 --> 08:36.280
And I have to say, I heard you 
exchanged blows with my master...

08:37.310 --> 08:42.290
So I expected more of a brutish 
woman, but you're certainly...

08:44.250 --> 08:48.230
Even from my view as another woman, 
you cut quite the feminine figure.

08:48.230 --> 08:52.830
Are you mocking me?! 
A knight has no need of femininity!

08:52.830 --> 08:53.840
Is that right?

08:54.100 --> 08:56.630
Well, your say doesn't 
really factor into it.

08:56.630 --> 09:00.140
What matters is that 
you've caught his eye.

09:01.510 --> 09:03.460
What are you talking about?

09:03.460 --> 09:05.900
Would telling you really 
make a difference?

09:06.350 --> 09:07.240
No.

09:07.600 --> 09:10.220
Nothing would change, even if I told you.

09:10.610 --> 09:13.490
You will never leave here again.

09:15.580 --> 09:18.240
Then... you really are here to...

09:19.110 --> 09:21.750
Now, for the finishing touches.

09:29.000 --> 09:30.710
Is this it for me?

09:48.770 --> 09:50.270
What are these clothes?

09:51.050 --> 09:53.890
So she wasn't here to 
interrogate or torture me?

09:57.400 --> 09:58.890
This scent...

09:59.320 --> 10:01.430
Who puts scented oils on prisoners of war?

10:02.390 --> 10:05.670
But that's not the 
real question, which is:

10:05.670 --> 10:08.290
what am I being prepared for?

10:09.310 --> 10:13.050
Now, then, I would say 
you're looking presentable.

10:13.560 --> 10:17.560
Is this some sort of barbarian 
ritual for prisoners?

10:18.910 --> 10:20.300
Don't tell me—

10:23.650 --> 10:25.760
What was that?! Thunder?

10:25.760 --> 10:28.950
No, that shout could 
belong to no one else.

10:31.980 --> 10:33.210
It's him, then.

10:43.370 --> 10:44.420
Well, now...

10:45.080 --> 10:49.380
It's like night and day, Crystal Helmet.

11:02.590 --> 11:06.280
We had no time to exchange 
names during the battle...

11:06.280 --> 11:10.420
I am heir to Great Chief Uldyn One Eye,

11:10.420 --> 11:12.210
Thundering Voice Veor.

11:12.780 --> 11:15.860
Seeing him again like this, 
he's absolutely massive!

11:16.450 --> 11:20.290
And those golden eyes... 
He can't be human.

11:21.310 --> 11:24.520
I see what you people are after...

11:28.250 --> 11:31.340
My grandfather told me of the Eastern 
Expedition that happened 20 years ago,

11:31.340 --> 11:32.390
that he was part of...

11:33.080 --> 11:36.880
It sounded like a fairy tale, 
but, now the truth is clear.

11:45.410 --> 11:48.130
Those inhuman eyes reveal all!

11:49.350 --> 11:52.910
I am of the Lavillant Margraves 
of the Illdoren Kingdom,

11:52.910 --> 11:55.000
youngest daughter to the 
former lord, Mattius,

11:55.000 --> 11:57.240
commander of the Eastern Expeditionary 
Force's First Company,

11:57.240 --> 11:58.610
Serafina de Lavillant!

12:00.260 --> 12:02.710
And I have no desire to beg for mercy!

12:03.030 --> 12:05.490
However this sacrifice works, 
do with me as you will!

12:10.780 --> 12:16.150
That's right. No matter what happens to 
me, I can at least maintain my dignity!

12:16.150 --> 12:17.890
Serafina...

12:17.890 --> 12:20.800
Sera, then. A good name.

12:21.070 --> 12:25.590
That said, Sera, 
what's this talk of a sacrifice?

12:27.100 --> 12:31.600
I've brought you here 
to take you as my bride.

12:38.110 --> 12:41.070
B-Bride?! Who?!

12:41.070 --> 12:42.260
You.

12:42.260 --> 12:42.860
Whose?!

12:42.860 --> 12:43.650
Mine.

12:43.650 --> 12:44.820
I've heard of no such thing!

12:46.340 --> 12:48.040
You can't fool me!

12:48.040 --> 12:49.530
You're trying to lower my guard

12:49.530 --> 12:51.750
so I can be used in some bizarre ritual!

12:51.750 --> 12:55.450
If that was the idea, 
why wait all this time?

12:56.140 --> 12:58.970
But aren't we enemies?!

12:58.970 --> 13:00.940
Who says you can't wed your enemy?

13:00.940 --> 13:02.460
Everybody!

13:02.730 --> 13:07.700
Well, that may be the case in 
the west, but it isn't our way.

13:07.700 --> 13:08.850
What?

13:10.150 --> 13:13.610
For generations, my clan...

13:15.100 --> 13:19.950
has made a tradition of taking 
lady knights as our brides!

13:23.270 --> 13:26.170
Th-This is madness!

13:27.240 --> 13:30.710
Do you really think that insane 
logic is enough to convince me?!

13:30.710 --> 13:31.870
It's not?

13:31.870 --> 13:34.220
Not at all!

13:34.220 --> 13:39.530
You already said I can 
do with you as I will.

13:41.100 --> 13:43.560
Or was that all talk?

13:44.510 --> 13:46.010
I was careless!

13:46.910 --> 13:52.100
All that said, I don't make this decision 
out of respect for law or tradition.

13:52.510 --> 13:55.640
When we crossed swords, 
your quality was apparent to me.

13:57.260 --> 14:01.360
The sword speaks in greater 
volume than thousands of words.

14:01.870 --> 14:05.770
I sensed a profound 
sincerity from your blade.

14:09.240 --> 14:11.280
It was enough that I fell 
for you in that moment.

14:12.780 --> 14:15.730
Fell... for...?

14:18.500 --> 14:23.700
That being the case, you won't be 
taken against your will, so relax.

14:24.610 --> 14:26.300
We'll speak later, Sera.

14:30.910 --> 14:32.050
W-Wait a moment!

14:33.790 --> 14:36.300
Wh-Wha...

14:38.010 --> 14:41.010
What is going on here?!

14:41.010 --> 14:44.010
You're being courted, 
if it wasn't obvious.

14:48.610 --> 14:55.120
Seven Years Ago

14:48.620 --> 14:55.120
m 10 0 l 160 0 l 170 10 l 170 50 l 160 60 l 160 60 l 10 60 l 0 50 l 0 10

14:48.620 --> 14:55.120
Illdoren Kingdom
Province of Margrave Lavillant
Eau de Marie

14:58.510 --> 15:01.120
The king has sent forth orders.

15:02.830 --> 15:05.630
The 17th Eastern Expedition 
is to commence.

15:07.140 --> 15:12.890
m 10 0 l 150 0 l 160 10 l 160 60 l 150 70 l 150 70 l 10 70 l 0 60 l 0 10

15:07.140 --> 15:12.890
Margrave
Sidius de Lavillant

15:07.780 --> 15:09.710
My sister, Serafina...

15:10.260 --> 15:12.890
You have been named as captain 
of the first company.

15:16.420 --> 15:19.390
Earn glory that befits the Lavillant name.

15:19.660 --> 15:20.370
I will!

15:23.160 --> 15:23.980
Wait.

15:27.060 --> 15:30.700
There's an invitation to a banquet 
from from Countess Ildhal.

15:31.730 --> 15:33.280
What of it?

15:34.840 --> 15:37.790
Well, it was addressed 
to "Princess" Serafina.

15:42.050 --> 15:44.040
I will attend, of course.

15:51.060 --> 15:52.970
Get that thief!

15:53.380 --> 15:55.500
Sounds like it pays well.

15:55.500 --> 15:59.150
I'm scared, though... A pal of mine 
who signed up never made it back.

15:59.150 --> 16:01.310
An expedition to the east?

16:01.310 --> 16:03.500
I'm gonna join the volunteer army!

16:05.190 --> 16:07.210
Hey, it's the Lavillants' coach!

16:28.870 --> 16:31.580
My, what a rare guest to have.

16:31.580 --> 16:33.220
She certainly is.

16:35.940 --> 16:39.010
The quality of food has 
been so poor as of late.

16:39.010 --> 16:42.360
But the longer the war goes on, 
the more we profit from it.

16:42.360 --> 16:43.720
Indeed...

16:46.020 --> 16:49.400
Princess Serafina certainly cuts a figure.

16:50.030 --> 16:53.500
She's more dashing than she is beautiful.

16:54.030 --> 16:55.680
Someone like that, commanding knights.

16:55.680 --> 16:57.480
What a state of affairs.

16:57.480 --> 16:59.420
Imagine, being led by a woman.

16:59.420 --> 17:03.300
That said, she is among the 
strongest of the order.

17:03.300 --> 17:07.160
And it's only natural for a Lavillant 
to command an army, but...

17:07.160 --> 17:09.650
What's the point in a woman being strong?

17:18.230 --> 17:19.560
I want to go home.

17:20.650 --> 17:22.040
Lady Serafina.

17:22.870 --> 17:26.070
Here you are. We were looking for you.

17:26.070 --> 17:30.110
You shouldn't be alone out here. 
Please, join us.

17:31.770 --> 17:34.740
It's been so long. 
I wonder how many years it's been.

17:35.010 --> 17:39.410
I heard you were named a commander 
for the Eastern Expedition?

17:39.410 --> 17:40.330
Yes.

17:40.330 --> 17:46.750
How dreadful! Isn't the east full 
of violent, undiscovered creatures?

17:46.760 --> 17:50.440
Rumors tell of fire-breathing 
dragons and other monsters.

17:50.440 --> 17:53.130
Dragons and monsters are 
the stuff of fables.

17:53.130 --> 17:55.960
But it'll still be dangerous.

17:55.960 --> 17:59.010
Since you're going to 
fight the barbarians...

17:59.300 --> 18:03.150
Aren't they supposed to be more 
like animals in human form?

18:03.150 --> 18:06.250
And they kidnap lady knights 
and use them as sacrifices!

18:06.250 --> 18:09.030
If the eastern lands are 
really that terrible,

18:09.030 --> 18:11.300
no woman should set foot upon them.

18:14.350 --> 18:16.410
Conquering the east

18:16.410 --> 18:19.160
has been a goal of the 
Illdoren Kingdom since its founding...

18:19.800 --> 18:23.050
As a member of the nobility, 
it is an honor to be sent there

18:23.050 --> 18:25.620
for the sake of the 
people and their peace!

18:26.770 --> 18:29.810
You should leave that sort of 
thing to the men to handle.

18:29.810 --> 18:33.150
What possible good could come 
from fighting as a woman?

18:33.150 --> 18:35.870
Even Princess Wysteresia, 
whom you so looked up to,

18:35.870 --> 18:39.210
ended up going missing on the battlefield.

18:39.210 --> 18:41.560
There is no greater happiness as a woman

18:41.560 --> 18:43.400
than to get married and 
manage a household.

18:51.130 --> 18:52.810
They have it so easy.

18:53.830 --> 18:56.660
A veritable feast accompanied 
with lively music...

19:01.780 --> 19:05.700
While the people only grow hungrier, 
as our crops continue to fail...

19:05.700 --> 19:08.080
S-Someone, help!

19:15.300 --> 19:16.590
That's enough!

19:18.510 --> 19:21.300
Resist and I won't guarantee your lives.

19:23.070 --> 19:24.620
These people are...

19:27.730 --> 19:29.350
That sword... She's a noble.

19:29.350 --> 19:32.170
It don't matter! We gotta do this!

19:41.340 --> 19:45.070
This is your first time stooping 
to this sort of thing, isn't it?

19:46.300 --> 19:48.120
It's better than dying of hunger!

19:48.120 --> 19:49.830
You'd never understand!

20:00.090 --> 20:02.510
And you'll never do evil again?

20:02.510 --> 20:04.590
We can really take it?

20:04.590 --> 20:05.350
Yes.

20:06.310 --> 20:07.710
Thank you!

20:07.710 --> 20:10.120
I'll be able to feed my kid!

20:11.450 --> 20:13.080
We'll never do it again.

20:14.520 --> 20:15.480
Come on.

20:15.480 --> 20:16.280
Yeah.

20:18.850 --> 20:20.200
We really owe her...

20:20.200 --> 20:21.100
Yeah!

20:22.830 --> 20:24.620
Just endure a bit longer.

20:25.050 --> 20:27.010
I will conquer the east

20:28.740 --> 20:31.670
so that you all can live fuller lives.

20:39.570 --> 20:40.880
I take my leave now.

20:41.420 --> 20:45.850
I will fight with all I have for 
the people and for the kingdom.

20:45.850 --> 20:46.890
Please, watch over me...

20:49.260 --> 20:50.560
Princess Wysteresia.

20:50.560 --> 20:51.960
Serafina.

20:54.970 --> 20:56.150
Brother...

20:56.780 --> 20:59.900
Did you fail to find a 
husband again at the party?

21:00.930 --> 21:04.080
What are you saying? 
I was about to head out to—

21:04.080 --> 21:04.950
Silence.

21:05.670 --> 21:07.760
A woman, wanting to be a knight?

21:07.760 --> 21:10.020
How long will you insist 
on this selfishness?

21:10.020 --> 21:11.300
What are you saying...?

21:11.300 --> 21:13.800
You've more than established 
yourself at this point.

21:14.110 --> 21:16.290
You need to marry while 
there are viable prospects.

21:16.630 --> 21:18.710
A sword has never changed policy.

21:18.710 --> 21:21.340
Sera...

21:21.340 --> 21:26.420
Sera... Sera... Sera!

21:26.420 --> 21:30.180
Be my bride!

21:30.180 --> 21:32.180
Wh-What the—?!

21:32.180 --> 21:37.190
You will be my bride!

21:43.210 --> 21:47.130
A dream? Of the barbarian? But why?

21:51.300 --> 21:54.410
What is that sound?

22:08.970 --> 22:09.970
The Warrior Princess and the Barbaric King

22:10.850 --> 22:13.600
Translation

Timing

Editing

Quality Control

Translation Check

22:10.850 --> 22:13.600
Lee Francis

Andy Ellis

Zachary Carlysle

Salem Alabanza

